confirm.body:
Confirm the email of your Orchester account by opening this link within 24 hours:

{link}

If you did not sign up for Orchester just now, do not open the link; no account is created without it.

reset.body:
Choose a new password for your Orchester account by opening this link within 1 hour:

{link}

Setting a new password signs out every device of the account. If you did not ask for this, ignore this email; your password stays as it is.

invite.body:
Someone invited this email to a team server in Orchester. Open Orchester on your computer and sign in with this email (Settings › Orchester): the invite is there, with who sent it and what it is for.

It is open for 7 days. If you don't know anyone who uses Orchester, ignore this email; nothing happens without you.

{url}

inviteSignUp.body:
Someone invited this email to a team server in Orchester. To accept, create an Orchester account with this email first:

{url}

Then sign in to Orchester on your computer (Settings › Orchester): the invite is there, with who sent it and what it is for. It is open for 7 days. If you don't know anyone who uses Orchester, ignore this email; nothing happens without you.

twoFactorOn.body:
Two-factor authentication was turned on for your Orchester account. Signing in now also asks for a code from your authenticator app, or one of your recovery codes.

If you did not do this, change your password and check your account's security at once:

{url}

twoFactorOff.body:
Two-factor authentication was turned off for your Orchester account. Signing in now asks only for your password, and you cannot accept invites to team servers until you turn it on again.

If you did not do this, change your password and turn two-factor authentication on again at once:

{url}

recoveryCodeUsed.body:
One of your Orchester recovery codes was just used to sign in. Each code works once; you can make new ones in your account's security settings.

If you did not do this, change your password and make new recovery codes at once:

{url}
